    <briefdescription>
<para>Shader engine orchestrator — owns the GL pipeline for background rendering. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implements <ref refid="classjuce_1_1OpenGLRenderer" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">juce::OpenGLRenderer</ref>. Owns the OpenGL context, fullscreen quad, background pass, and 4 ping-pong buffer slots.</para>
<para>Component painting is enabled — JUCE composites components natively on top of the background rendered here. <ref refid="structshader_1_1_controller" kindref="compound">Controller</ref> only draws behind components.</para>
<para>Owned by <ref refid="classend_1_1_view" kindref="compound">end::View</ref> as a single member. View delegates all GL lifecycle to this class and stays clean.</para>
<para>Thread contract:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="structshader_1_1_controller_1a261eecb70bbd676b432e328c166816f1" kindref="member">attach()</ref> / <ref refid="structshader_1_1_controller_1ac888bf835596922d42e6b530c8156670" kindref="member">detach()</ref> / <ref refid="structshader_1_1_controller_1ae60aa6289254c3bbec119ad0e1cd4b3e" kindref="member">resize()</ref> : MESSAGE THREAD</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>renderOpenGL / newOpenGLContextCreated / openGLContextClosing : GL THREAD </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
